# Build output directory.
#
# The species bundle (images + gzipped descriptions) is generated by
# tools/build_species_bundle.py and is gitignored. This placeholder keeps the
# directory present so `flutter test` and `flutter build` can resolve the asset
# path on a fresh clone — without it the build fails outright, which looks like
# a bug rather than missing setup.
#
# Until the bundle has been built, every species falls back to the placeholder
# image and no profile text is shown at all.
